      "updated": 1789706917212,
      "created": 1789560816695,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WAIT! haven't we violated one of our properties?\nIn case 2, the tree we see is actually a subtree\nwe'll go into more detail on this later.\n",
