      "created": 1789578019171,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. inserted = root        -> color black\n2. inserted uncle = red  -> recolor uncle, father, and grandfather\n3. inserted node's uncle = black (triangle) -> rotate parent\n4. inserted node's uncle = black (line) -> rotate grandparent and recolor\n                                                 father and grand father",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
