    {
      "id": "EZ61s0K36neC-mtFeRVn1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1396.2518954113023,
      "y": 10800.622548475012,
      "width": 844.6666870117188,
      "height": 560,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#d22b2b",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1011688662,
      "version": 900,
      "versionNonce": 1163516064,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789706917213,
      "created": 1789578743637,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "what kind of properties are we possibly violating by \ninserting a red node\n\nWe only consider configurations that can arise after inserting\na red node into an already valid red-black tree.\n\nSince red insertion preserves black-height, the only nontrivial\nnew violation is a red-red violation with the parent.\n\nTherefore the parent must be red, the grandparent must\nbe black, and the only possibilities are:\n\nnew node is the root,\nuncle is red,\nuncle is black and the shape is a triangle,\nuncle is black and the shape is a line.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "what kind of properties are we possibly violating by \ninserting a red node\n\nWe only consider configurations that can arise after inserting\na red node into an already valid red-black tree.\n\nSince red insertion preserves black-height, the only nontrivial\nnew violation is a red-red violation with the parent.\n\nTherefore the parent must be red, the grandparent must\nbe black, and the only possibilities are:\n\nnew node is the root,\nuncle is red,\nuncle is black and the shape is a triangle,\nuncle is black and the shape is a line.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
