    {
      "id": "654qrifLP8tgn2d6E2DQU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -750.087764888732,
      "y": 15168.616832355463,
      "width": 598.2000122070312,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 441552842,
      "version": 951,
      "versionNonce": 1438514528,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789706911384,
      "created": 1789580845253,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "scenarios to fix up\n1. inserted = root        \n    -> color black\n2. inserted node's uncle = red  \n    -> recolor uncle, parent, and grandparent\n3. inserted node's uncle = black (triangle) \n    -> rotate parent\n4. inserted node's uncle = black (line) \n    -> rotate grandparent and recolor \n       parent and grandparent",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "scenarios to fix up\n1. inserted = root        \n    -> color black\n2. inserted node's uncle = red  \n    -> recolor uncle, parent, and grandparent\n3. inserted node's uncle = black (triangle) \n    -> rotate parent\n4. inserted node's uncle = black (line) \n    -> rotate grandparent and recolor \n       parent and grandparent",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "jNLC3ubuw-g9IXE1f5PRG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -764.6258939802326,
      "y": 14880.82371201982,
      "width": 688.5,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#d22b2b",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 769721994,
      "version": 831,
      "versionNonce": 1540837728,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789706911384,
      "created": 1789580845253,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "red black tree properties\n 1. A node is either red of black.\n 2. the root is black\n 3. leaves (NIL) are black.\n 4. If a node is red, then its children are black.\n 5. All paths from a node to its NIL descendants \n    contain the same number of black nodes.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "red black tree properties\n 1. A node is either red of black.\n 2. the root is black\n 3. leaves (NIL) are black.\n 4. If a node is red, then its children are black.\n 5. All paths from a node to its NIL descendants \n    contain the same number of black nodes.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "whJDV08-_FLQYl-A48CzV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1027.3658322807405,
      "y": 15391.2017165198,
      "width": 65.82499694824219,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#d22b2b",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
