      "updated": 1789706911385,
      "created": 1789580924162,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "red black tree properties\n 1. A node is either red of black.\n 2. the root is black\n 3. leaves (NIL) are black.\n 4. If a node is red, then its children are black.\n 5. All paths from a node to its NIL descendants \n    contain the same number of black nodes.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "red black tree properties\n 1. A node is either red of black.\n 2. the root is black\n 3. leaves (NIL) are black.\n 4. If a node is red, then its children are black.\n 5. All paths from a node to its NIL descendants \n    contain the same number of black nodes.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
