      "updated": 1789706911386,
      "created": 1789583463728,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "steps\n1.  insert 10 and color it red\n2. case 2: case recolor 9 & 13 black and 12 red\n3. case 3: right rotate on parent\n4. case 4: left rotate grandparent and recolor \n       father and grand father",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "steps\n1.  insert 10 and color it red\n2. case 2: case recolor 9 & 13 black and 12 red\n3. case 3: right rotate on parent\n4. case 4: left rotate grandparent and recolor \n       father and grand father",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "KhJSi375dUZ-UeIBRS2sv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2450.046124801692,
      "y": 14971.868611717327,
      "width": 688.5,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#d22b2b",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 306547594,
      "version": 1141,
      "versionNonce": 1457279328,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789706911386,
      "created": 1789583463728,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "red black tree properties\n 1. A node is either red of black.\n 2. the root is black\n 3. leaves (NIL) are black.\n 4. If a node is red, then its children are black.\n 5. All paths from a node to its NIL descendants \n    contain the same number of black nodes.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "red black tree properties\n 1. A node is either red of black.\n 2. the root is black\n 3. leaves (NIL) are black.\n 4. If a node is red, then its children are black.\n 5. All paths from a node to its NIL descendants \n    contain the same number of black nodes.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "M2tD0wnheNu_sKzGZgmY5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2461.587947341932,
      "y": 15256.281772923769,
      "width": 598.2000122070312,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1163889226,
      "version": 1317,
      "versionNonce": 1309353312,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789706911386,
      "created": 1789583463728,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "scenarios to fix up\n1. inserted = root        \n    -> color black\n2. violating node's uncle = red  \n    -> recolor uncle, parent, and grandparent\n3. violating node's uncle = black (triangle) \n    -> right rotate parent\n4. violating node's uncle = black (line) \n    -> left rotate grandparent and recolor \n       parent and grand parent",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "scenarios to fix up\n1. inserted = root        \n    -> color black\n2. violating node's uncle = red  \n    -> recolor uncle, parent, and grandparent\n3. violating node's uncle = black (triangle) \n    -> right rotate parent\n4. violating node's uncle = black (line) \n    -> left rotate grandparent and recolor \n       parent and grand parent",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7dWzepDR9r3O-VGsSgJD0",
