      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "how do we know this?",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "how do we know this?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "i_1Un-T0EqxRbUwQCSANF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7528.725830268636,
      "y": -123.58226725525981,
      "width": 482.2430854306773,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bn0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2028915040,
      "version": 454,
      "versionNonce": 808004960,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789705147246,
      "created": 1789680002626,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The right spine of a tree is the path formed by\nstarting at \nthe root and repeatedly following right children. \nnodes 4 and 4 constitute the BSTs spine",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The right spine of a tree is the path formed by starting at \nthe root and repeatedly following right children. \nnodes 4 and 4 constitute the BSTs spine",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9O2ba3TE5CLkkI4LytwH1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8073.773807332844,
      "y": -111.54758324073458,
      "width": 456.3567312852201,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bn1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 347840672,
      "version": 315,
      "versionNonce": 966025568,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789705137745,
      "created": 1789680062162,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A completely right-leaning tree is a tree whose\nentire set of nodes lies on that spine.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A completely right-leaning tree is a tree whose entire set of nodes lies on that spine.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "idRKOE0SXUsJ3bj4J3rei",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11873.541420307307,
      "y": -760.2605483421248,
      "width": 663.7000122070312,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bnm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1144726688,
      "version": 431,
      "versionNonce": 1400495264,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789704923140,
      "created": 1789680605632,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Left and right rotations are inverses.\n ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Left and right rotations are inverses.\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
