      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789704923142,
      "created": 1789682819647,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "basically: (Config C) -> spine -> (config B)\n\nso (any Config) -> spine -> (any other config)\n\nGoing through the spine proves that a path\nalways exists.\n\nit is not claiming that this is the shortest\npath.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "basically: (Config C) -> spine -> (config B)\n\nso (any Config) -> spine -> (any other config)\n\nGoing through the spine proves that a path always exists.\n\nit is not claiming that this is the shortest path.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
