    {
      "id": "6P5fs7hoepKnCxUQ9pFhz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4.955222167237139,
      "y": 8004.818203967679,
      "width": 516.7666625976562,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#d22b2b",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "buL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 193817952,
      "version": 738,
      "versionNonce": 245502112,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789706917214,
      "created": 1789683613232,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why do we always color\ninserted node red?",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why do we always color inserted node red?",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "20BNbhHO6NXMTDh9AGhqN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -16.176575876209085,
      "y": 8126.514821670451,
      "width": 489.5666809082031,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#d22b2b",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "buM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2124430496,
      "version": 534,
      "versionNonce": 1565981856,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789706917214,
      "created": 1789683728103,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "properties\n 1. A node is either red of black.\n 2. the root is black\n 3. leaves (NIL) are black.\n 4. If a node is red, then its children are black.\n 5. All paths from a node to its NIL descendants \n    contain the same number of black nodes.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "properties\n 1. A node is either red of black.\n 2. the root is black\n 3. leaves (NIL) are black.\n 4. If a node is red, then its children are black.\n 5. All paths from a node to its NIL descendants \n    contain the same number of black nodes.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cDRxwPRcbCpYXnFowRfRj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -27.579924977231713,
      "y": 8321.827255358876,
      "width": 494.5666809082031,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "buO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1794656608,
      "version": 642,
      "versionNonce": 1586391200,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789706917214,
      "created": 1789683765055,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hints: \n - inserting black ALWAYS violates \n   one property. Which is it?\n - using information from answering \n   above, how does this compare to \n   inserting red.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hints: \n - inserting black ALWAYS violates \n   one property. Which is it?\n - using information from answering \n   above, how does this compare to \n   inserting red.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4-z3fGckateWgtiyc7Gar",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 567.4453171662863,
      "y": 7874.722909722588,
      "width": 685.3833618164062,
      "height": 770,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "buP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2078470496,
      "version": 1315,
      "versionNonce": 502813856,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789706917214,
      "created": 1789683912662,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The key\n - Black insertion changes black-height, \n - Red insertion does not change black-height,\n\nput another way:\n - Replacing a NIL leaf by a black internal node \n   adds one black node to those paths, so\n   property 5 is disturbed.\n - Replacing a NIL leaf by a red internal node \n   adds no black node to those paths, so \n   property 5 is preserved.\n\n 5. All paths from a node to its NIL descendants \n    contain the same number of black nodes.\n\ninserting red MIGHT violate property 4:\n  - If a node is red, then its children are black.\n\ninserting red and breaking property 4 \nis also highly local red-red issue; it is easy \nand cheaper to fix. (this becomes more \nobvious later)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The key\n - Black insertion changes black-height, \n - Red insertion does not change black-height,\n\nput another way:\n - Replacing a NIL leaf by a black internal node \n   adds one black node to those paths, so\n   property 5 is disturbed.\n - Replacing a NIL leaf by a red internal node \n   adds no black node to those paths, so \n   property 5 is preserved.\n\n 5. All paths from a node to its NIL descendants \n    contain the same number of black nodes.\n\ninserting red MIGHT violate property 4:\n  - If a node is red, then its children are black.\n\ninserting red and breaking property 4 \nis also highly local red-red issue; it is easy \nand cheaper to fix. (this becomes more \nobvious later)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "gxzYkWrFvvOlT0s31wMrJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2004.360998625601,
      "y": 7894.372706829315,
      "width": 196.5833282470703,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "buQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 210649248,
      "version": 340,
      "versionNonce": 826589344,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789706917214,
      "created": 1789684191670,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "red-black tree:",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "red-black tree:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "US_OSK3P_yzuvPZL2NqN1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1292.4793328244004,
      "y": 7958.400111101584,
      "width": 550.9666748046875,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "Ffy6fMe9O246FBuPiLSZB",
      "index": "buRp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1460694176,
      "version": 983,
      "versionNonce": 2015603872,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789706917214,
      "created": 1789684204852,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " - inserting 13 violates property 4\n\n\n\n - inserting 4 breaks no properties\n\n\n\n - inserting black always violates \n   property 5: (unless the tree is empty)\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " - inserting 13 violates property 4\n\n\n\n - inserting 4 breaks no properties\n\n\n\n - inserting black always violates \n   property 5: (unless the tree is empty)\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
