      "text": "Exercise",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Exercise",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "QVlJWx1-gBXAKb04QRQ2O",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3728.0053579827313,
      "y": -2854.1153448157424,
      "width": 756.2249755859375,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c02D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 807040160,
      "version": 514,
      "versionNonce": 1585103200,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789701591849,
      "created": 1789701185002,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    - Can we left-rotate node 8? Why?\n    - Can we right-rotate node 8? Why not?\n    - For the valid rotation, which node rotates down? \n    Which rotates up?\n    - What subtree, if any, must be transferred?\n    - What does the resulting tree look like?",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "    - Can we left-rotate node 8? Why?\n    - Can we right-rotate node 8? Why not?\n    - For the valid rotation, which node rotates down? \n    Which rotates up?\n    - What subtree, if any, must be transferred?\n    - What does the resulting tree look like?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "IxHt15ircyWn3ng1dIa1d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3667.445831233582,
      "y": -2558.6124770432866,
      "width": 572.7750244140625,
      "height": 490,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c02N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 81614176,
      "version": 816,
      "versionNonce": 49256608,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789701487038,
      "created": 1789701266033,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Let's look at a right rotation at node 10.\n\nWe call the node we rotate the \nrotate-down node.\n\nTo rotate a node right, it MUST have\na non-NIL left child. We call that\nchild the rotate-up node.\n\nThe rotate-up node's right child may\nbe NIL or the root of a subtree. \n\nIf it is a subtree, that subtree must \nbe transferred during the rotation.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Let's look at a right rotation at node 10.\n\nWe call the node we rotate the \nrotate-down node.\n\nTo rotate a node right, it MUST have\na non-NIL left child. We call that\nchild the rotate-up node.\n\nThe rotate-up node's right child may\nbe NIL or the root of a subtree. \n\nIf it is a subtree, that subtree must \nbe transferred during the rotation.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
