      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1196472480,
      "version": 136,
      "versionNonce": 427253920,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789705150176,
      "created": 1789703142094,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "spine length = node #",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "spine length = node #",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "-CzwoaqCcNxSvV3Rrw1-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8807.880022321022,
      "y": 309.4713135230444,
      "width": 582.7000122070312,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c041",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1224154272,
      "version": 212,
      "versionNonce": 2035779744,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789705246808,
      "created": 1789703281842,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "“How could we make this look more like a right-going chain?”",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "“How could we make this look more like a right-going chain?”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "mnwv8AblqtMDvOqvvhTWT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12721.531968748064,
      "y": -629.1280024626908,
      "width": 370.20001220703125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c049",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2041260192,
      "version": 92,
      "versionNonce": 1984053408,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789704923142,
      "created": 1789703339369,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Lemma?\nLeft and right rotations are inverses.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Lemma?\nLeft and right rotations are inverses.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dg5TyhutZAiw_3ysUO-Bg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13577.130854474673,
      "y": 878.3287804990779,
      "width": 721.0499877929688,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c04C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1206687904,
      "version": 143,
      "versionNonce": 1097936032,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789704923142,
      "created": 1789703367114,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Lemma?\nAny n-node BST can be transformed \ninto a right spine using right rotations.\n\nLemma?\nLeft and right rotations are inverses.\n\nTheorem: Can transform any n-node BST into another n-node BST using \njust rotations!",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Lemma?\nAny n-node BST can be transformed \ninto a right spine using right rotations.\n\nLemma?\nLeft and right rotations are inverses.\n\nTheorem: Can transform any n-node BST into another n-node BST using \njust rotations!",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "naLHQ0wxXZAYlmR-_5nQK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1072.4495204186624,
      "y": -290.7753016413137,
      "width": 264.75,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c04D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 438537376,
      "version": 390,
      "versionNonce": 1281952928,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789704043675,
      "created": 1789703983280,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why rotations?",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why rotations?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
