      "updated": 1789799667143,
      "created": 1789791133069,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For the set  {1, 4, 5, 10, 16, 17, 21} of keys, draw \nbinary search trees of heights 2, 3, and 6.\n\nthis time we use just insertion.\n\nlet's start with height two what should be the root?\n\ndon't be afraid to guess and experiment!",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For the set  {1, 4, 5, 10, 16, 17, 21} of keys, draw \nbinary search trees of heights 2, 3, and 6.\n\nthis time we use just insertion.\n\nlet's start with height two what should be the root?\n\ndon't be afraid to guess and experiment!",
